net: airoha: add an owned PON downstream RX drain boundary

Only after complete FE retirement, stop QDMA1 RX DMA, drain callback/NAPI
ownership and discard queued/partial frames. Preserve normal NAPI lifetime.

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -925,7 +925,7 @@
